{
  "_id": "tg-take",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Enoch … was not; for God took him, Gen. 5:24 (Moses 7:69). I will take you to me for a people, Ex. 6:7. not take the name of the Lord thy God in vain, Ex. 20:7 (Deut. 5:11; Prov. 30:9; 2 Ne. 26:32; D&C 136:21). thou take of their daughters unto thy sons, Ex. 34:16. Ye take too much upon you, Num. 16:3. Lord gave, and the Lord hath taken away, Job 1:21. I will take the stony heart out of their flesh, Ezek. 11:19 (36:26).",
